OL,3,GNEWSAChin-up champion secures Guinness
OL,4,AWorld Record title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former professional mixed martial
OL,7,Fartist has broken the Guinness World
OL,8,FRecord for most chin-ups in an hour
OL,9,Fwhilst wearing a 20lb weight.
OL,11,FDamien Rooney from Burren, outside
OL,12,FNewry, clocked up 499 reps to beat the
OL,13,Fprevious record of 495.
OL,15,FHe now intends to build upon the record
OL,16,Fand push towards a fresh challenge for
OL,17,Fthe 24-hour record which could require
OL,18,Fas many as 10,000 reps.
OL,20,FDamien, who runs his own gym, hopes to
OL,21,Ftake on his next record attempt in
OL,22,FApril 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
